  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "數位環境分析與理論閱讀",
    "sub_ename": "DIGITAL ANALYSIS AND PROOFREADING",
    "describe_ch": "這個課程規劃是基礎於Prof. Raoul Bunschoten 發展的一套可供建築和都市設計的創新設計方法論；我們稱之為都市廊道(Urban Gallery)。都市廊道理論是一套聚焦在減緩和適應氣候變遷所帶給都市衝擊和壓力的設計方法。本課程核心是「數位環境分析」與「理論閱讀」。透過這樣的教學，讓學生了解如何將環境分析實質的做出來並反應在設計的配置發展中。",
    "describe_eh": "The course is based on the urban corridor theory created by Prof. Raoul Bunschoten. Urban corridor theory aims at reducing the climatic change impact associated with the behavior of energy consumption. The course will be divided into two phases included with 「Digital Analysis」and 「Proofreading」. Through the course application, the students will learn to embed the site analysis into architectural strategy.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
